    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Explore the Mountains of Kaliman -<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/00e7296f7264dba94c4038e85b626bc2.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LUNARIS</strong> is a 2D <strong>Metroidvania</strong> with pixel art and <strong>realistic lighting</strong>. Fast-paced combat, <strong>challenging bosses</strong>, and powerful <strong>abilities</strong> to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/3e9acda339a209a282e79f186e85a7cb.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=42 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABANDONED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient energy known as <strong>Alma</strong> gave birth to life and forgotten civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the mountain\u2019s collapse, deformed creatures emerged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lunaris</strong>, a legendary warrior, sealed the unstable energy and vanished.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAIN CHARACTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Yami</strong>, an adventurer guided only by instinct and his glowing companion, a firefly named <strong>Bobby</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and collect <strong>souls</strong> to unlock new abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new ways to traverse an abandoned world full of secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/3e9acda339a209a282e79f186e85a7cb.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=42 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/ccf764832e3184db1ac22bfb9ce4a585.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/3b928bf751ed719ea380bf35366e095e.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NPCS AND INTERACTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll meet characters who may help you \u2014 or make things worse.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn <strong>items, upgrades, or side quests</strong> by interacting with NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barbak</strong>, the blacksmith, can upgrade your weapons\u2026 when he feels like it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade <strong>ancient artifacts</strong> with greedy NPCs for valuable rewards.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROGRESSION AND ABILITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LUNARIS</strong> is about growing stronger:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New <strong>paths</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New <strong>powers</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New <strong>possibilities</strong>.<br>Every <strong>skill</strong> you earn unlocks new doors \u2014 and new challenges. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/a46e0f5ec688584f5890f96277354793.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/3e528746679ce0d7ffda54e72b84907f.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/3e9acda339a209a282e79f186e85a7cb.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=42 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBAT AND CHALLENGES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>brutal bosses</strong> that test your skill and reward you with new abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome <strong>challenging platforming</strong> that demands precision and timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world of <strong>dynamic lighting</strong> and visual storytelling.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPEEDRUN AND RANKINGS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who crave a challenge and master <strong>every second</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in <strong>online rankings</strong> for speedrunners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See who can finish <strong>LUNARIS</strong> in the <strong>fastest time</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Challenge your reflexes, curiosity, and persistence.<br>- The Mountains of Kaliman are waiting for you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/8552c892da61bc0bfc37f2400eedcc4e.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/7df3465c72faa12d6e8d385477a26eca.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/dabf0168c8b28d81efb12e60db7f07ed.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Explore the Mountains of Kaliman -<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/00e7296f7264dba94c4038e85b626bc2.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LUNARIS</strong> is a 2D <strong>Metroidvania</strong> with pixel art and <strong>realistic lighting</strong>. Fast-paced combat, <strong>challenging bosses</strong>, and powerful <strong>abilities</strong> to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/3e9acda339a209a282e79f186e85a7cb.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=42 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABANDONED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient energy known as <strong>Alma</strong> gave birth to life and forgotten civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the mountain\u2019s collapse, deformed creatures emerged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lunaris</strong>, a legendary warrior, sealed the unstable energy and vanished.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAIN CHARACTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Yami</strong>, an adventurer guided only by instinct and his glowing companion, a firefly named <strong>Bobby</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and collect <strong>souls</strong> to unlock new abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new ways to traverse an abandoned world full of secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/3e9acda339a209a282e79f186e85a7cb.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=42 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:/