_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/3e9acda339a209a282e79f186e85a7cb.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=42 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBAT AND CHALLENGES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>brutal bosses</strong> that test your skill and reward you with new abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome <strong>challenging platforming</strong> that demands precision and timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world of <strong>dynamic lighting</strong> and visual storytelling.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPEEDRUN AND RANKINGS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who crave a challenge and master <strong>every second</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in <strong>online rankings</strong> for speedrunners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See who can finish <strong>LUNARIS</strong> in the <strong>fastest time</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Challenge your reflexes, curiosity, and persistence.<br>- The Mountains of Kaliman are waiting for you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/8552c892da61bc0bfc37f2400eedcc4e.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/7df3465c72faa12d6e8d385477a26eca.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863790/extras/dabf0168c8b28d81efb12e60db7f07ed.avif?t=1752167579\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></h2>",
